                                "sense_id": "97dff627-0a00-31e5-8c52-cea5ff72fb8b",
                                "text": "As might be expected, characters of the aspides themselves are not of much value in pollen identification, but they are easily recognized and many three-pored, aspidate grains are broadly categorized as \"betuloid\" in studies of airborne pollen."
